OL,3,GNEWSANo slowing down: Skater off to
OL,4,Aworld games aged 60
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn amateur skateboarder is set to
OL,7,Frepresent his country for the first
OL,8,Ftime almost 50 years after he took up
OL,9,Fthe sport.
OL,11,FDarren Miles, 60, from Plymouth, is to
OL,12,Frepresent Great Britain in the slalom
OL,13,Fevent at the World Skate Games in
OL,14,FParaguay later this month.
OL,16,FMiles will take part in three
OL,17,Fdisciplines as part of the team made up
OL,18,Fof a mixture of professionals and
OL,19,Famateurs.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
