OL,3,GNEWSANo slowing down: Skater off to
OL,4,Aworld games aged 60
OL,5,
OL,6,F"When I was 10 I never thought I would
OL,7,Fbe skateboarding at 60 for my country
OL,8,Fso that's the main attraction," he
OL,9,Fsaid.
